			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Update Tauri ecosystem submodules with reformatted permission docs\n\nUpdate the PluginsWorkspace and Tauri submodules to their latest upstream revisions, both of which include formatting changes to autogenerated HTML permission reference tables.\n\nKey changes:\n- **PluginsWorkspace:** Reformatted permission tables for dialog, fs, log, and shell plugins from deeply nested multi-line tags to a simpler flat structure with blank rows between entries.\n- **Tauri:** Normalized HTML table formatting across all permission reference files in core crates (app, event, image, menu, path, resources, tray, webview, window) by flattening table rows to single-line format and removing inconsistent tab indentation.\n\nThis continues the ongoing documentation formatting standardization across the Tauri ecosystem without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "f5ef9358bdf64343e96418ec52a9cb08be713d9a"
		},
