			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Batch update Tauri ecosystem submodules\n\nAdvance 30 submodules within Land/Dependency/Tauri to their latest upstream revisions. This covers the core Tauri runtime, plugin suite (Authenticator, CLI, Dialog, FS, FSExtra, FSWatch, GlobalShortCut, HTTP, Log, Notification, OS, Positioner, Process, SQL, Shell, StrongHold, Updater, Upload, WebSocket), tooling (TauriAction, TauriDocs, Tao, Wry, TauriSearch, TauriToml), and auxiliary modules (Meetings, PluginsWorkspace, RFCs).\n\nKey changes integrated:\n- **Cleanup:** Remove stray `.DS_Store` from Meetings.\n- **Tests:** Refactor TauriSearch pattern guide fixtures to use lowercase `<rater>` tags with proper nesting.\n- **Docs:** Widespread normalization of HTML table indentation from spaces to tabs and self-closing void elements across plugin READMEs and autogenerated permission reference docs.\n\nThis keeps the Land editor's dependency tree aligned with upstream formatting conventions and improves documentation readability without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "25368630c5deabea522b15966536877c3e86d3e8"
		}
